Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.01,0:01:55.39,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:03.40,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}再等我一下 一下就好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.57,0:02:09.15,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}我如此祈愿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.49,0:02:11.32,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{=15}{\fad(300,300)\be20}只是 只是
